    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.animate\n\n### Description\n\nHi,\r\nJust installed mini.animate today and really apreciate it.\r\nBut I have an issue where when I open a split window, the window do not respect transparency. Background become black for 1s and then get back to transparent.\r\n\r\nPlease see : \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/58638832/6a75a78d-afdd-4f5a-b285-cfe1cfc691c7\r\n\n\n### Neovim version\n\nNVIM v0.10.0-dev-463+g780ab11b9\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTbh, I don't really know how to reproduce this issue.\r\nI've tested without all of my plugins and it still remains the same.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nOpen split window with transparent background\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nOpen split window and get black background during 1s.",
